  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p> </p> <p><span>Underpronators to mild overpronators will be treated to the lightest and most cushioned version of the GEL-Cumulus ever.</span></p> <ul> <li><span>Refined open mesh with Discrete Eyelets that disburse lace tension for a customized fit and enhanced upper comfort.</span></li> <li><span>ComforDry Sockliner for cushioning performance and anti-odor properties for a cooler, drier, healthier environment.</span></li> <li><span>Heel and forefoot GEL Cushioning Systems.</span></li> <li><span>Guidance Trusstic System integrates Guidance Line construction for enhanced gait efficiency while providing midfoot structural integrity. </span></li> <li><span>Guidance Line vertical flex groove decouples the tooling along the line of progression for enhanced gait efficiency.</span></li> <li><span>FluidRide for the ultimate combination of bounce back and cushioning properties with reduced weight and exceptional durability.</span></li> <li><span>Impact Guidance System (I.G.S.) employs linked componentry to enhance the foot's natural gait from heel strike to toe-off.</span></li> <li><span>Solid rubber outsole.</span></li> <li><span>Wt. 8.5 oz.</span></li> </ul><hr /><p>Daily miles feel smoother when comfort, support, and a consistent ride come together. The ASICS GEL-Cumulus 16 is built to help keep your stride cushioned from heel strike to toe-off, with a breathable upper and responsive platform that works well for everything from training runs to long days on your feet.</p><ul><li>Refined open-mesh upper with Discrete Eyelets to help distribute lace tension for a more customized fit</li><li>ComforDry Sockliner adds underfoot cushioning and helps keep the interior feeling fresh</li><li>FluidRide midsole balances lightweight cushioning with bounce-back response and durability</li><li>Guidance Trusstic System and Guidance Line construction support smoother transitions</li><li>Approximate weight: 8.5 oz.</li></ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>For the best fit, we recommend starting with your usual size. Reviewers often describe the feel as secure and supportive, while runners who prefer a little extra room up front for longer miles may like going up a half size.</p> <p><strong>Cushioning & Road Feel</strong></p><p>This ride leans comfortably cushioned without losing its smooth, steady feel on the road. GEL cushioning in the heel and forefoot helps soften impact, while the Guidance Line and FluidRide platform help keep transitions efficient and natural through each step.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p><p>Many reviewers highlight step-in comfort right away, with several noting the shoe feels ready to run in from the first wear. Longtime fans also call out lasting comfort over repeated miles, making it a strong option for regular rotation use.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-Cumulus 16 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Midnight</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203A733-103</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official ASICS® shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 3</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 38.2</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 39.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.1</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 41.4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42.6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 9</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 43.2</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr></tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</details>\n",
